. Engl.</source><year>2005</year><volume>44</volume><fpage>3057</fpage><lpage>3061</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15828044</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><label>12</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rinker</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Yan</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Two-dimensional LNA/DNA arrays: estimation the helicity of LNA/DNA hybrid duplex</article-title><source>Chem. Commun.</source><year>2006</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>2675</fpage><lpage>2677</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><label>13</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Rothemund</surname><given-names>PWK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Folding DNA to create nono-scale shapes and patterns</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2006</year><volume>440</volume><fpage>297</fpage><lpage>302</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16541064</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B14"><label>14</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>JH</given-names></name><name><surname>Seeman</surname><given-names>NC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Synthesis from DNA of a molecule with the connectivity of a cube</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>1991</year><volume>350</volume><fpage>631</fpage><lpage>633</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2017259</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B15"><label>15</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Zhang</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Seeman</surname><given-names>NC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The construction of a DN